---
title: Spaghetti Bolognese
servings: 4
tags: [pasta]
prep time: 10 minutes
cook time: 40 minutes
---

Heat @olive oil{2%tbsp} in a #large pot{} over medium heat. Add @onion{1}(diced), @carrot{1}(finely diced) and @garlic{3%cloves}(minced) and cook until soft, about ~{8%minutes}.

Add @ground beef{1%lb} and brown, breaking it up, about ~{6%minutes}. Season with @salt{1%tsp} and @black pepper{1/2%tsp}.

Stir in @tomato paste{2%tbsp}, then @crushed tomatoes{28%oz} and @dried oregano{1%tsp}. Simmer uncovered for ~{25%minutes}.

Meanwhile cook @spaghetti{1%lb} in a #stockpot{} of salted water until al dente. Drain and toss with the sauce. Serve with @parmesan{1/2%cup}(grated).
